"kaya ang register ay 40 qubits. Dalawang valence proton at dalawang valence neutron ang bumubuo sa $^{44}\\mathrm{Ti}$,\n"
"na may 4,000 symmetry-allowed determinant &mdash; humigit-kumulang anim na beses ang $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}$ basis, gamit ang\n"
"40 qubits sa halip na 24.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is the larger of the two examples that the notebook can solve exactly, so you can compare\n"
"the hardware result with an exact reference.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ito ang mas malaki sa dalawang halimbawa na maaaring lutasin nang eksakto ng notebook, kaya maikukumpara mo\n"
