#, no-wrap
msgid "The Quantum Compute Client support described in the build instructions is optional. You need it only to submit hardware jobs; the local checks and saved-bitstring processing work without it.\n"
msgstr "Opsyonal ang suporta sa Quantum Compute Client na inilarawan sa mga tagubilin sa pag-build. Kailangan mo lang ito para magsumite ng mga hardware job; gumagana nang wala ito ang mga lokal na pagsusuri at ang pagpoproseso ng mga naka-save na bitstring.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The build produces `nuclear_shell_driver` in `$NUCLEAR_SRC/build` and copies `data/USDB.snt` beside it. Despite its filename, that file contains the **USDA** interaction, as its header states. The supplied example describes two valence protons and two valence neutrons in the $sd$ shell, which is $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}$, the same nucleus as the Python small-scale hardware example.\n"
msgstr "Gumagawa ang build ng `nuclear_shell_driver` sa `$NUCLEAR_SRC/build` at kinokopya ang `data/USDB.snt` sa tabi nito. Sa kabila ng pangalan ng file, ang interaction na **USDA** ang laman ng file na iyon, ayon sa header nito. Inilalarawan ng ibinigay na example ang dalawang valence proton at dalawang valence neutron sa $sd$ shell, na ang $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}$, ang parehong nucleus gaya ng Python small-scale hardware example.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the workflow locally {#check-the-workflow-locally}"
msgstr "Suriin ang workflow nang lokal {#check-the-workflow-locally}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, run the Hamiltonian regression test:\n"
msgstr "Una, patakbuhin ang Hamiltonian regression test:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The test builds the complete 640-determinant basis for $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}$, diagonalizes it, and checks that the ground-state energy is $-40.472331$ MeV, the exact energy in the Python example. Passing confirms that the Fortran application builds the same Hamiltonian as the Python example. Because SQD diagonalizes in a subspace of this basis, no run of this application can report an energy below $-40.472331$ MeV for $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}$; the closer a run gets, the better its sampled subspace.\n"
msgstr "Binubuo ng test ang kumpletong 640-determinant basis para sa $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}$, dinidiagonalize ito, at sinusuri na ang ground-state energy ay $-40.472331$ MeV, ang eksaktong energy sa Python example. Kinukumpirma ng pagpasa na binubuo ng Fortran application ang parehong Hamiltonian gaya ng Python example. Dahil nagdidiagonalize ang SQD sa isang subspace ng basis na ito, walang takbo ng application na ito ang makakapag-ulat ng energy na mas mababa sa $-40.472331$ MeV para sa $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}$; kung mas malapit ang takbo, mas maganda ang na-sample nitong subspace.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
