msgid "Without `--runtime`, the application generates copies of the reference determinant rather than sampling a simulated quantum circuit. This checks the classical filtering and diagonalization pipeline; it does not test circuit sampling. The selected subspace has dimension one, so its energy is the reference determinant's diagonal matrix element.\n"
msgstr "Kapag walang `--runtime`, gumagawa ang application ng mga kopya ng reference determinant sa halip na mag-sample ng isang simulated na quantum circuit. Sinusuri nito ang classical na filtering at diagonalization pipeline; hindi nito sinusubok ang circuit sampling. Ang napiling subspace ay may dimension na isa, kaya ang energy nito ay ang diagonal matrix element ng reference determinant.\n"

